278	    /**
279	     * Reports whether an owner is flagged deleted (soft-deleted). A {@code null} flag is treated as
280	     * not deleted. This is the single definition of an owner being deleted, shared by every rule
281	     * that must ignore soft-deleted owners.
282	     *
